<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτι-χάρακτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>newly graven,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράμμα</span> Epigr. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.209d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>newly ploughed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				2.65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>freshly wounded,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				25.498
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> metaph. of
			darkness, <i>newly cleft</i> by light, ib. <i><span class="en">
				27.5
			</span></i>; of colour on ripening grapes, ib.<i><span class="en">
				12.311
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
